<p>1. Ye ghairat ka khuda hai uski ghairat ka takaza tha<br />
khula sar dekh ke naize se jo ye sar girata tha<br />
nahi hai paas gar chadar to rakhlo haath hi sar par<br />
Sar e abbas aata hai</p>

<p>2. Bhara hoga lahu aankho&#39;n mein uski khud hataungi<br />
mai bachpan ki tarah se bhai ka chehra dhulaungi<br />
agar mumkin hai to dede koi paani mujhe laakar<br />
Sar e abbas aata hai</p>

<p>3. Haaye..<br />
mujhe uthna padega bibiyo tazeem ko uski<br />
mai maa ummul banee ki simt se ghazi ko chumungi<br />
arey sambhale sar koi aun o mohammad ke yaha&#39;n aakar<br />
Sar e abbas aata hai</p>

<p>4. Isi ehsaas se usne nazar apni jhukayi hai<br />
use maloom hai ye kitna ghairat mand bhaai hai<br />
chupaye kis tarha zainab pade hai neel shano par<br />
Sar e abbas aata hai</p>

<p>5. Mila pani use pucha to kya batlayegi zainab<br />
