nigahein uski dhundhegi sakina ko yaha&#39;n aakar<br />
Sar e abbas aata hai</p>

<p>6. The sabki jholiyo&#39;n mein apne apne laadlo ke sar<br />
Roqaiyya, umme laila, umme farwa, madar e asghar<br />
uthi kehte hue har maa se apne laal ka rakhkar<br />
Sar e abbas aata hai</p>

<p>7. Takallum shamiyo ki aurte bhi roti jaati hai<br />
haye, ali ki betiya&#39;n jaldi se zakhmo ko chupati hai<br />
